# UI-HARVEST-ICON-1 R1: the owner's ui test (2026-11-27): the forester's status icon showed while
# zoomed out and was gone after zooming back in. The same sequence: the icon appears, zoom out
# twice, zoom back in to the closest level; the icon must be produced at every stage
# (status_icons.drawn) and drawn (the screenshots, status_icon_zoom pixel check).
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
wait frames 5
key b
wait frames 3
select 801
rotate 0
expect title build 801
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
key esc
wait frames 3
wait fact inspection.status_icon == 1 within 200000
wait fact status_icons.drawn >= 1 within 10000
look 1156 516
wait frames 10
note fact zoom.target
screenshot icon_start
checkpoint icon_start
wheel -3
wait frames 30
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
screenshot icon_out1
wheel -3
wait frames 30
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
screenshot icon_out2
checkpoint zoomed_out
wheel 12
wait frames 30
look 1156 516
wait frames 10
expect fact zoom.at_max == 1
expect fact status_icons.drawn >= 1
screenshot icon_closest
checkpoint zoomed_in
quit
